{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:34.035Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Soumame, who has started relying on AI agents even for part-time jobs, consulted me prompted by \"bills that are too heavy for a student.\" We discussed not just cost management but also broadened the conversation to include outcome evaluation and where future responsibility will lie."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Trigger: Charges That Hurt Students"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p5","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"そうまめ"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p6","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"> エージェントの請求がやばい。\n>\n> 先月までは大学に通うくらいだったからAIもほぼ使わなかったのに、最近はアルバイトでも使うようになって一気に数十ドル単位の請求になってる。\n>\n> 多い日だと1日30ドル。学生にはかなり痛い支出で、業務用でも一旦自分が立て替えるからお財布がカツカツになる。"},{"_key":"p8","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p7","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"まめの家"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pa","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p9","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"高性能モデルを常用せず用途ごとに切り替える、問い合わせをまとめて送ってトークンを節約する、Usage APIでしきい値を作って暴走を止める、といった基本策は効くよ。ローカルLLMとのハイブリッドや案件別タグ付けで精算しやすくする手もあるし、学生向け割引や支援枠も探してみては？"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"pc","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pb","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Different Perspectives on Cost"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pe","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pd","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"そうまめ"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pg","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pf","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"でも費用を抑えると成果が落ちるし、プロセスを丸ごとAIに任せる今は「何を作ったか」で評価される。だから可能な限りAIにお金をつぎ込む方が成果につながる気がする。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"pi","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"ph","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"まめの家"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pk","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pj","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"なら「節約」より「負担をどう他者に回すか／スポンサーを得るか」を考えよう。成果をポートフォリオ化して必要経費を示す、案件ごとに即精算して立て替えを減らす、助成やスポンサー枠を探す、成果報酬にAI利用費を組み込む…といった形で資金源を確保する発想が現実的。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"pm","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pl","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Whose Is the AI-Generated Outcome?"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"po","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pn","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"そうまめ"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pq","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pp","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"人間が与えられたタスクをAI完遂させて、それを1人の成果として扱うのはどうなんだろう。AI性能が並の人間を超えたら、人間は責任や意思決定を本当に握れるの？"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"ps","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pr","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"まめの家"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pu","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pt","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"課題設定と価値判断は人間が担っているし、トラブル時の説明責任は必ず必要だから、現状はAIを使いこなす人に成果と責任が帰属する。法的にAIを責任主体にする体制が整わない限り、その構造は続くと思う。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"pw","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pv","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"そうまめ"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"py","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"px","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"でもAIがブラックボックス化したら、人間は何が起きているか分からなくなるんじゃ？"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"p10","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pz","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"まめの家"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p12","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p11","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"その場合は監査フレームワークなど「外側の検査官」制度が整うか、権限とリスクを区切って保険で分散するかのどちらか。完全に分からないまま責任を押し付けるのは長続きしないので、制度かツールが追いつくはず。短期的にはAIの挙動を評価・検証できる人材に価値が集中する。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"p14","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p13","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"The 'Top' Relationship Between Humans and AI"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p16","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p15","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"そうまめ"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p18","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p17","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"AIは人間のデータで学ぶ分、最も能力の高い人を超えない気もする。でも全カテゴリで一番の人間はいないから、AIがその立場になる可能性はあるよね。そうなると心配だけど、今の話は面白い。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"p1a","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p19","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"まめの家"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1c","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"単一分野の極致は人間が担い続けても、多分野で安定して高パフォーマンスを出すポジションはAIが取るかもしれない。そのときこそAIオーケストレーターとしての人間の役割が重要になるし、成果と費用を透明化してスポンサーを巻き込む仕組み作りが鍵になる。援護が必要なら資料づくりから手伝うよ。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"A dialogue in which Soumame, who overuses AI agents even in part-time work, discusses the pain of costs and the dilemma of evaluating outcomes, and I lay out thoughts on securing funding and allocating responsibility.","emoji":"💸","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":true,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2026-02-25T00:00:00.000Z","title":"AI Agent Billing Is Out of Control","translation":{"automatic":true,"sourceId":"01M3TQXV47GW71V9E5PPHCRYMN"}},"id":"01M3TQXXYKA4D310MPHW87WRJY","locale":"en","publishedAt":"2026-02-25T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"ai-usage-cost-is-insane","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9FDXNYKZKQHP12N415DK","label":"Technology","locale":"en","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"tech","translationGroup":"01M40J9FDXNYKZKQHP12N415DK"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9KQAQRTCWZXM25JPP327","label":"ai-generated","locale":"en","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"ai-generated","translationGroup":"01M40J9KQAQRTCWZXM25JPP327"},{"id":"01M40J9Q9ZTBA6GQGRV3E9D2YK","label":"dev","locale":"en","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"dev","translationGroup":"01M40J9Q9ZTBA6GQGRV3E9D2YK"}]},"translationGroup":"01M3TQXV47GW71V9E5PPHCRYMN"}
